    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/54-hallwell-avenue-adamstown-adamstown-dublin-k78w8n6\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 54 Hallwell Avenue, Adamstown in Dublin.\r\n\r\nWelcome to this charming terraced home, ideally positioned in the heart of Adamstown and offering a comfortable blend of modern living, practical design, and excellent convenience.\r\n\r\nThe property presents an attractive exterior with a welcoming entrance and a neat residential setting. Inside, the ground floor opens into a bright and inviting living room, providing a comfortable space for relaxing, entertaining, or everyday family use. Large windows help bring natural light into the room, creating a warm and pleasant atmosphere.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the kitchen/dining area forms the heart of the home. This generously arranged space offers ample room for cooking, dining, and daily living, with direct access to the rear garden through double doors. The reasonably large backyard adds further appeal, offering an excellent outdoor area for dining, children’s play, gardening, or simply enjoying some private open space.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor also includes a convenient bathroom and a separate laundry room, both of which add excellent practicality to the layout and help keep the main living areas organised.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers two spacious bedrooms, each benefitting from its own ensuite bathroom. This is a particularly appealing feature, providing privacy and convenience for residents, guests, or those sharing the home. Both rooms are well proportioned and offer comfortable accommodation, with the layout well suited to first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors.\r\n\r\nAn additional advantage is the attic space, which offers potential for future conversion, subject to the relevant requirements. This provides an exciting opportunity for purchasers who may wish to further enhance the home over time.\r\n\r\nLocated within easy reach of essential amenities, Hallwell Avenue is well connected. Adamstown train station is a short walk away, providing direct access to Dublin city centre, while the area is also served by several bus routes and main road networks. Local schools, parks, shops, and sports facilities are all nearby, making this a highly convenient location for modern living.\r\n\r\nThis property is ideal for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking to downsize without compromising on comfort or convenience. With its two spacious ensuite bedrooms, practical ground-floor layout, laundry room, guest bathroom, generous kitchen/dining space, reasonably large backyard, and attic conversion potential, 54 Hallwell Avenue offers an excellent opportunity in a sought-after Adamstown setting."
      },
